#: ../../docs/storage/index.rst:3 5e353202227c492f8c19c91bf9a5425c
msgid "存储节点"
msgstr "Storage Nodes"

#: ../../docs/storage/index.rst:5 a01aafa1fa8c4c418a7925b42fdf0c45
msgid "本章介绍cnSRC存储节点情况"
msgstr "This chapter describes cnSRC storage nodes."

#: ../../docs/storage/index.rst:7 22d15cdb46be40e4a42e9f8908028a96
msgid ""
"经过多次升级，cnSRC 目前具备约10PB的分布式存储， 具备高性能、高可靠性、高可扩"
"展性的特点， 既有SSD高性能存储，也有HDD大容量存储， 其中/home主要用于用户个人"
"数据和结果数据存储， /o9000主要用于处理数据的长期存储， /ibo9000主要用于存储"
"原始观测数据， /p9550主要用于存储处理数据处理的中间结果。"
msgstr ""
"After several upgrades, cnSRC provides about 10 PB of distributed storage "
"with high performance, reliability, and scalability, including SSD and HDD "
"tiers. /home is mainly for personal and result data; /o9000 for long-term "
"processed data; /ibo9000 for raw observation data; /p9550 for intermediate "
"processing results."

#: ../../docs/storage/index.rst:15 58d2ae18cc954319b300eea0df4355e9
msgid ""
"目前，cnSRC系统存储了超过 2PB 的数据， 包括MWA、ASKAP、MeerKAT 和 VLBI 望远镜"
"的观测数据。"
msgstr ""
"cnSRC currently stores over 2 PB of data, including observations from MWA, "
"ASKAP, MeerKAT, and VLBI telescopes."

